      "mergeID": "697794d2d446bef6e67f4ec1",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I think this started happening since the last January 22nd open beta update. Tho before this update the game would sometimes freeze for 5 to 10 seconds after clicking on the user profile from the launchpad menu. I only noticed this on PCVR so Im not sure if it affects any other platform. I also havent noticed any patterns to it either it just sometimes happens and sometimes doesnt. But more often it does. The game just completely locks up and it never unfreezes- even after 15 mintues of waiting. No crash- no error- just frozen until you restart it. SteamVR just shows idle frame times too as if the game wasnt even running so ig it is a crash of some sort.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Game locks out (Freezes) when clicking on user profile from launchpad.",
